<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets $250 mln REMIC 1996-61.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $250 mln REMIC 1996-61.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal National Mortgage Association (Fannie Mae or FNMA) said it issued $250 million in Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1996-61, backed by 7.5-percent 30-year relocation mortgages, priced November 5 and has a settlement date of December 27, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
